- Initial package of ximaging 1.9.3+git20261018.45d292f
  * Build with %optflags and the distribution linker flags,
    keeping the OpenMP optimizations enabled
  * JPEG, PNG and TIFF support through the system libraries
  * Add ximaging-bmp-prototype.patch: fix the img_open_bmp()
    signature, which did not match its prototype
  * Install without forcing root ownership
  * Install the app-defaults file into /usr/share/X11/app-defaults
  * Add a desktop entry and install the application icons
